1. Open your browser and navigate to the application login screen.
2. Log in using the student credentials:
   - **Email**: `samjoshuacs2002@gmail.com`
   - **Password**: `student123`
3. You will be redirected to the Student Portal `/my-application`.
4. Observe that **no forbidden error toaster** appears on page load!
5. Edit your **Personal Details** card, change your **Full Name**, upload/change your **profile photo**, and click **Save Changes**.
6. Observe that:
   - The card updates instantly with the new name and photo.
   - The profile footer in the sidebar instantly updates to show your new name and uploaded avatar photo!
   - Under the hood, the backend automatically synced these changes to the `users` and `students` tables in the database.
7. Refresh/reload the page.
8. Observe that the page loads cleanly (showing the loading spinner briefly) and then resolves to either your application details page or the blank new form (if you don't have an application yet), without rendering a blank screen or crashing!
